# Keep byte-exact line endings so the SHA-256 manifest in latex/results/
# verifies identically on every platform (Linux LF vs Windows CRLF).
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites LF->CRLF on checkout/archive and
# every released-result hash fails. Data + integrity files must stay untouched.
*.json   -text
*.sha256 -text
*.csv    -text
*.txt    -text
*.log    -text
